<h1>Render de collection (bom)</h1>
<div class="hint">
  Mesma saida, mas <code>render partial: "lab/shared/post_row", collection: @posts</code>
  resolve o template uma unica vez. Compare o tempo de render com a pagina anterior.
</div>

<%= render partial: "lab/shared/post_row", collection: @posts, as: :post %>
